果終了時のダメージが540% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","副手在战斗开始时获得350点能量。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、副官のSPが350回復"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","效果结束时的伤害提升至560% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","効果終了時のダメージが560% ATKにUP"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":11,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","副手存活时，自身持续恢复生命值。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","副官が生存している間、タドールのHPが持続的に回復"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当副手存活时，自身每秒恢复5%最大生命值。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","副官が生存している間、タドールのHPが毎秒、HP上限の5%分回復"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","血誓长锋"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","血誓の刃"]]}